===Continue forward deeper into the Great Tomb{{subst:void|<!--104366001-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Universal Matrix" Great Tomb of the Nameless Titan|''"I bid farewell to this beautiful world, so that we can reunite in your memories in the way I want."''<br />''"You will see the footprints I left behind in the ripples of past reverie."''<br />''"I have never had any other fate beyond this memory."''<br />''"So, please remember me with 'love,' like that eternal footnote in all the faded sagas."''<br />''"Now, open this book."''<br /><br />''"I'll be waiting for you in the past."''}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Dan Heng:''' It's time to end this.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Return "March 7th" to us and end this pointless conflict.
:'''"Evernight":''' ...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How long are you going to stand there and watch?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Nameless always fight their own battles.
:'''"Evernight":''' Don't get the wrong idea. I just need some time to deal with some unnecessary trouble...
:'''"Evernight":''' The encryption key written by those geniuses is already invalid♭
:'''"Evernight":''' How about we play a game, dear (Trailblazer)?
:'''"Evernight":''' Don't worry. It won't take long. It's a simple multi-choice question. A? Or B?
:'''"Evernight":''' I understand it's too difficult for you to treat the Chrysos Heirs as extrapolated data. Then, why don't we assume for now that they're living, breathing humans...
:'''"Evernight":''' Now, the cosmos will face an unprecedented catastrophe, and your choice will determine the fate of countless planets.
:'''"Evernight":''' On the one side are companions who've weathered every storm with you. They fought with everything they've got and obtained a 1% chance of victory. However, should you choose that 1%, there'll be massive sacrifices no matter the outcome.
:'''"Evernight":''' On the other side, there's a simple button: {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|The "Oblivion" will burn away all traces of their existence, as well as your entire memory of this trip.}} But it will also halt the brewing catastrophe, and spare the universe from Destruction.
:'''"Evernight":''' Those who are to be sacrificed will be fully aware of the decision you need to make. There will be no concealment or deception...
:'''"Evernight":''' Tell me, what will you choose?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't try to trick me with that trolley problem.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Such an outdated theme. Not worth discussing!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What makes it only 1%?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're twisting more than just one concept here.
:'''"Evernight":''' You're right. This choice is meaningless and unimportant. The only interesting thing...
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Is the number of people making that choice.}}
:'''"Evernight":''' I've just posed the same question to Dan Heng. The answer doesn't matter. Let me see... Is this Trailblaze spirit truly as unified as you all claim it to be?
:'''"Evernight":''' Now, why don't you prove it to me?
:'''Cyrene:''' Wait!
:'''(Trailblazer):''' Cyrene?
:'''Cyrene:''' Another "damsel-in-distress rescue"... plays out again!
:'''"Evernight":''' Still think you can do something, little pink memosprite?
:'''"Evernight":''' What weapons do you have to stand against me besides your somewhat witty words?
:'''Cyrene:''' Don't underestimate me! Besides my charm and eloquence I can&mdash;
:'''Cyrene:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|"&mdash;and stir up ripples of past reverie!"}}
:'''"Evernight":''' What...?
:'''Cyrene:''' We don't have time for endless chatter at crucial moments like this!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Carelessness is your greatest weakness, Evernight.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are these memosprites?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No holds barred. Awesome move!
:'''Cyrene:''' Quick, (Trailblazer)! Take this&mdash;
:'''Cyrene:''' Take the shot! I can't hold on much longer!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do I take a photo of you?
::'''Cyrene:''' Of course not! Take a photo... of Miss Evernight!
::Do I take a photo of her?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do I take a photo of her?
:'''Cyrene:''' M-Make sure you get the focus right!
:'''Cyrene:''' No time to explain. Quick!
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

